    "text": "This program has not been compiled or run against any input. It plans trips from Lapland that each deliver one primary gift, plus any extras that fit.\n\n**Approach**\n1. Gifts already within range D of Lapland are loaded and delivered at once, with no movement.\n2. For every other gift, I precompute the smallest number of seconds k such that coasting from rest at an integer velocity (vx, vy) puts the sleigh within D of the gift at time k. The sleigh accelerates along x at time 0 and along y at time 1.\n3. Each trip loads one primary gift, any extra gifts that are also within D of the sleigh at time k, and 3 carrots per non-zero velocity component.\n4. A round trip turns around at time k, with one acceleration per axis, and stops back at Lapland at time 2k+1. It then floats one more second, because two accelerations need a float between them. A round trip therefore costs 2k+2 seconds.\n5. Trips are chosen greedily by score per second. If no round trip fits in the remaining time, one final one-way trip delivers the best gift that still fits.\n6. The velocity is chosen so that twice its largest component is at most the maximum acceleration at the initial weight. Weight only drops after loading, so every acceleration stays within the limit.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\ntypedef long long ll;\nstruct G{string name;ll s,w,x,y;ll k=0,vx=0,vy=0;bool done=false,ok=false;};\nint T,D,W,N;\nvector<ll> L,A;\nll amax(ll w){for(int i=0;i<W;i++)if(w<=L[i])return A[i];return 0;}\nint main(){\n    scanf(\"%d %d %d %d\",&T,&D,&W,&N);\n    L.resize(W);A.resize(W);\n    for(int i=0;i<W;i++)scanf(\"%lld %lld\",&L[i],&A[i]);\n    vector<G> g(N);\n    char buf[64];\n    for(int i=0;i<N;i++){\n        scanf(\"%s %lld %lld %lld %lld\",buf,&g[i].s,&g[i].w,&g[i].x,&g[i].y);\n        g[i].name=buf;\n    }\n    vector<string> out;\n    ll D2=(ll)D*D;\n    for(auto&q:g){\n        if(q.x*q.x+q.y*q.y<=D2){\n            out.push_back(\"LoadGift \"+q.name);\n            out.push_back(\"DeliverGift \"+q.name);\n            q.done=true;\n        }\n    }\n    for(auto&q:g){\n        if(q.done)continue;\n        ll a=amax(q.w+6);\n        ll Aa=a/2;\n        if(Aa<=0)continue;\n        ll mx=max(llabs(q.x),llabs(q.y));\n        if(mx-D>Aa*(ll)T)continue;\n        ll k0=max(2LL,(mx-D)/Aa-2);\n        for(ll k=k0;k<=T;k++){\n            ll vx=llround((double)q.x/k),vy=llround((double)q.y/(k-1));\n            if(llabs(vx)>Aa||llabs(vy)>Aa)continue;\n            ll dx=k*vx-q.x,dy=(k-1)*vy-q.y;\n            if(dx*dx+dy*dy<=D2){q.k=k;q.vx=vx;q.vy=vy;q.ok=true;break;}\n        }\n    }\n    vector<int> ord(N);\n    iota(ord.begin(),ord.end(),0);\n    stable_sort(ord.begin(),ord.end(),[&](int a,int b){return g[a].s>g[b].s;});\n    ll cur=0;\n    while(true){\n        int best=-1;bool one=false;\n        for(int i=0;i<N;i++){\n            if(g[i].done||!g[i].ok)continue;\n            ll c=2*g[i].k+2;\n            if(cur+c>T)continue;\n            if(best<0||g[i].s*(2*g[best].k+2)>g[best].s*c)best=i;\n        }\n        if(best<0){\n            one=true;\n            for(int i=0;i<N;i++){\n                if(g[i].done||!g[i].ok)continue;\n                if(cur+g[i].k>T)continue;\n                if(best<0||g[i].s>g[best].s)best=i;\n            }\n            if(best<0)break;\n        }\n        G&p=g[best];\n        ll k=p.k,vx=p.vx,vy=p.vy;\n        int nz=(vx!=0)+(vy!=0);\n        ll mv=max(llabs(vx),llabs(vy));\n        vector<int> list={best};\n        ll sw=p.w;\n        ll px=k*vx,py=(k-1)*vy;\n        for(int id:ord){\n            if(id==best||g[id].done)continue;\n            ll dx=g[id].x-px,dy=g[id].y-py;\n            if(dx*dx+dy*dy>D2)continue;\n            ll w0=sw+g[id].w+3*nz;\n            if(amax(w0)>=2*mv){\n                sw+=g[id].w;\n                list.push_back(id);\n            }\n        }\n        ll lt=0;\n        auto fl=[&](ll to){\n            if(to>lt){out.push_back(\"Float \"+to_string(to-lt));lt=to;}\n        };\n        auto acc=[&](int axis,ll d){\n            if(d==0)return;\n            if(axis==0)out.push_back((d>0?\"AccRight \":\"AccLeft \")+to_string(llabs(d)));\n            else out.push_back((d>0?\"AccUp \":\"AccDown \")+to_string(llabs(d)));\n        };\n        if(nz>0)out.push_back(\"LoadCarrots \"+to_string(3*nz));\n        for(int id:list)out.push_back(\"LoadGift \"+g[id].name);\n        acc(0,vx);\n        fl(1);\n        acc(1,vy);\n        fl(k);\n        for(int id:list){\n            out.push_back(\"DeliverGift \"+g[id].name);\n            g[id].done=true;\n        }\n        if(one){break;}\n        acc(0,-2*vx);\n        fl(k+1);\n        acc(1,-2*vy);\n        fl(2*k);\n        acc(0,vx);\n        fl(2*k+1);\n        acc(1,vy);\n        fl(2*k+2);\n        cur+=2*k+2;\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",(int)out.size());\n    for(auto&s:out)printf(\"%s\\n\",s.c_str());\n}\n```",
